<section class="section section--flush-top">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Colors</h2>
    <p>Contrast is measured against WCAG 2.2: normal text needs 4.5:1, large text (24px+, or 19px+ bold) and icons need 3:1.</p>
    <ul class="swatches">
      <li><span style="background:#000000"></span><strong>Text</strong><code>--color-text</code> #000000<br>Headings · 21:1 on white</li>
      <li><span style="background:#3b3b3b"></span><strong>Body</strong><code>--color-body</code> #3b3b3b<br>Body copy, primary buttons · 11.2:1</li>
      <li><span style="background:#6b6b6b"></span><strong>Muted</strong><code>--color-muted</code> #6b6b6b<br>Secondary text · 5.3:1</li>
      <li><span style="background:#f4f4f4"></span><strong>Surface</strong><code>--color-surface</code> #f4f4f4<br>Header, footer, gray sections</li>
      <li><span style="background:#2c2c2c"></span><strong>Dark</strong><code>--color-dark</code> #2c2c2c<br>Darkest bands</li>
      <li><span style="background:#dadada"></span><strong>Border</strong><code>--color-border</code> #dadada<br>Dividers, outlines</li>
      <li><span style="background:#cc7722"></span><strong>Brand orange</strong><code>--color-accent</code> #cc7722<br>Big numbers, rules, icons only · 3.4:1</li>
      <li><span style="background:#a65c12"></span><strong>Orange for text</strong><code>--color-accent-text</code> #a65c12<br>Small orange text, orange buttons and bands · 5.1:1</li>
      <li><span style="background:#eb9f55"></span><strong>Orange on dark</strong><code>--color-accent-on-dark</code> #eb9f55<br>Small orange text on dark bands · 5.1:1</li>
      <li><span style="background:#006dff"></span><strong>Link blue</strong><code>--color-link</code> #006dff<br>Links, focus outline, logo · 4.5:1</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

